# Working in this repo

- Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) before you edit, and follow [How a change happens](../../AGENTS.md#how-a-change-happens).
- One issue, one branch, one pull request. Stay inside the current issue.
- Roxana reviews and merges. Do not deploy.
- Leave visitor behaviour as it is unless the issue asks for a behaviour change.
- Leave `vendor/demo-kit/` as it is. CI checks its checksum.
- Public writing uses plain words and real paths. No secrets, prices, or hostnames.
